OL,3,GNEWSAWoman's plea after cancer caught
OL,4,Aearly
OL,5,
OL,6,FWhen Mel McKechnie was first told she
OL,7,Fhad cancer, she said she "suddenly went
OL,8,Fcold".
OL,10,FShe said she was a 40-a-day smoker of
OL,11,Fcigarettes when she was diagnosed with
OL,12,Flung cancer following an invitation for
OL,13,Fscreening.
OL,15,FThe 63-year-old now backs NHS Cancer
OL,16,FAwareness Bus Tour, which will visit
OL,17,Fcommunities across Nottingham City and
OL,18,FNottinghamshire offering free cancer
OL,19,Fadvice, screening information, healthy
OL,20,Flifestyle support and mini health
OL,21,Fchecks.
OL,23,APub: 05-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,369,360,200,160,0,100
